{"reviews":[{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-0","r":1.0,"t":"Not current product","x":"This container has not been on the market with MK for years.  It must be very old product.  I would be afraid to use it on my eyes.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-1","r":5.0,"t":"eye makeup remover","x":"this product is great for sensitive skin. removed waterproof mascara without any issues. would highly recommend.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-2","r":5.0,"t":"The best eye makeup remover on the market.","x":"I have tried multiple eye makeup removes out there and always come back to this one. It works effortlessly on waterproof eye makeup. Never irritates your eyes and even has ingredients that help promote eyelash growth. Many years ago I sold Mary Kay but am no longer associated with the company. Mary Kay Ash believed in women and the power of their intelligence, influence, and integrity.  So I am always a woman that supports others women in business and in life.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-3","r":5.0,"t":"My favorite","x":"I have repurchased this for years. It is not greasy, and cleans better than any of drugstore brands. It takes off my waterproof mascara and waterproof eyeliner with no problem. I put it on a cotton ball. I used to buy this from a MK sales person but lately I've just been getting it from Amazon for convenience sake. It's the same quality as buying from a rep. Recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-4","r":1.0,"t":"It doesn\u2019t smell or feel like Mary K","x":"I\u2019m not sure this is actually Mary Kay make up remover. I\u2019ve used this same brand for 35 years and it doesn\u2019t smell right, feel right. I won\u2019t use it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-5","r":5.0,"t":"Doesn't irritate eyes","x":"This is the best remover I've ever used .Leaves no film ,does not burn at all .Removes everything .Never using anything else .Highly recommend","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-6","r":1.0,"t":"It's not Mary Kay","x":"I have been buying Mary Kay eye makeup remover for over10 years. This is either not Mary Kay or its been watered down. Don't waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-7","r":5.0,"t":"Excelente producto , llena todas las expectativas","x":"El producto cumple con lo que promete ,es c\u00f3modo, f\u00e1cil de usar y no maltrata la piel, sin duda lo volver\u00eda a comprar","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-8","r":5.0,"t":"it's works great","x":"I love item and does so we'll for removing my waterproof mascara and eyeliner. Also leaves your skin feeling soft.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-9","r":5.0,"t":"The Best!","x":"Very gentle in cleansing off eye makeup without the burn of other cleansers. The only one that I can use!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-10","r":5.0,"t":"I love it!","x":"It\u2019s so pretty when you swirl/shake it up, it literally looks like a gemstone lava lamp. It takes off my eye makeup super quick and easy, doesn\u2019t irritate your eyes at all, and you don\u2019t even have to rinse it off because it isn\u2019t oily. I will be using this forever!! Way better than pulling and rubbing at eyes with makeup remover wipes. Highly recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-11","r":5.0,"t":"Time Tested - 40+ years of Use!","x":"This was given to me as a gift when I was around 15 years old.  I am now in my 50s and will never change.  I have used many Mary Kay products off and on; they're all great but this is the one I will never switch from.  I have tried others when in a pinch (was out of town had to use my sister's - Aghgh!!!).  Guess what she got for Christmas?","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-12","r":1.0,"t":"Seller mixed with water to make it look like it was a full bottle. Not sealed.","x":"When I got the product it was not sealed. I didn't really think anything of it. However, when I lifted it to the light it was clear water was added to the product. Although it is oil free, the consistency is like oil and water and oil do not mix. More than half the product was water.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-13","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent","x":"This is hands down the best eye makeup remover available. However, the price is inflated. If you just go to the Mary Kay website and look for a consultant in your area, you can purchase the same item at the price that the company has advertised.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-14","r":5.0,"t":"It works!","x":"I have been looking for eye makeup remover for my stubborn, hard to remove mascara.  And i found this based on my search on Amazon.  It works so I will buy it again when run out of it.  :)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-15","r":5.0,"t":"Removes long-wear lip color","x":"Been using it for years. Heard it has been discontinued but hope it isn\u2019t! It removes the long-lasting lip color easily if you hold the applicator on your lips for 3 or 4 seconds.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-16","r":5.0,"t":"Removes long-wear lip color","x":"Been using it for years. Heard it has been discontinued but hope it isn\u2019t! It removes the long-lasting lip color easily if you hold the applicator on your lips for 3 or 4 seconds.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-17","r":5.0,"t":"It won\u2019t burn your eyes.","x":"I use this product to take off my eyeliner and mascara, and it comes off so easily.  It\u2019s fantastic for removing make up without burning your eyes.  I love this product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-18","r":1.0,"t":"Product looked like there was some sort of goop inside and the box was crushed","x":"Do not purchase the Mary Kay Make up remover!  Nasty residue inside the bottle and the box was crushed and seemed like it go wet at one time.  Yuck.  Not thank you!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-19","r":5.0,"t":"the best","x":"this is the only makeup remover ive used for the past 6 years and its the only one ill ever use. the bottle lasts me close to a year. well worth the money","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-20","r":1.0,"t":"This does not work very well","x":"I have used a lot of eye makeup removers This had good reviews But it didn\u2019t work well for me should of returned it but waited too long . Does not work","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-21","r":5.0,"t":"Limpia muy bien","x":"Este a sido mi desmaquillarte favorito desde hace como 10 a\u00f1os. Me encanta como te quita f\u00e1cilmente todo el maquillaje aun que sea  Waterproof.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-22","r":5.0,"t":"BEST REMOVER ON EARTH","x":"The absolute best eye makeup remover you will ever find. The smoothness and power combination is unbelievable. I will never use another.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-23","r":5.0,"t":"Best makeup remover","x":"I've tried a dozen different makeup remover and like this one best.  On my tenth bottle.  Never stings my eyes or leaves a residue.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07GWF7NS9-24","r":5.0,"t":"Costs a little more but best eye makeup remover around","x":"Love this product. Been using for 30 years. Doesn\u2019t  sting eyes. Removes mascara gently and doesn\u2019t leave you with blurry vision.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise it for effectively removing waterproof mascara and eyeliner.","cites":[2,3,4,9,11,15]},{"text":"Many say it is gentle and does not irritate or burn the eyes.","cites":[2,3,6,10,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe it as non-greasy or non-oily and leaving no film.","cites":[4,6,11]},{"text":"Some negative reviewers suspect the product is not genuine Mary Kay, old, or watered down.","cites":[1,5,7,13]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers mention long-term loyalty and repurchasing for years.","cites":[3,4,12]}]},"qa":[]}